   "heading": "All divisions in Maharashtra > Regions",
   "text": "Geographically, historically, politically, and according to cultural sentiments, Maharashtra has five main regions:\nKonkan ( Konkan division )\nWestern Maharashtra (Desh) , also known as Desh ( Pune division )\nNorth Maharashtra ( Nashik division ) - contains Khandesh\nMarathwada ( Aurangabad division )\nVidarbha ( Nagpur and Amravati divisions) - formerly Central Provinces and Berar",
